    "group": "Null Maiden Vigil",
    "summary": "When the opposing player's Command phase reaches its Battle-shock step, each enemy unit within 12\" of any of your ANATHEMA PSYKANA models must make a Battle-shock test when it is a PSYKER unit or has dropped below its Starting Strength. A unit Below Half-strength instead applies -1 to that test in this phase. As the designer's note explains, every enemy PSYKER unit and every enemy unit missing models within the aura's range is tested, not only units Below Half-strength.",
